   <indicator ascending="0" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output Indicator</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.1. The management and technical operations of the Secretariat are available and implemented
2.1 Extend to which the partners (Government of AIS Countries) and Embassies are facilitated under the AIS Forum
2.2 Start-up Hub and Women Entrepreneurs programmes are developed and engaged AIS countries
2.3 The Blue Economy Index of AIS Countries is developed
2.4 Joint research and student exchange is implemented by AIS Forum
3.1 Numbers of technical Assistance given by AIS Secretariate to strengthen the partnership between AIS Countries
3.2 Numbers of partnership between AIS countries established under the AIS Support Facility
4.1 Numbers of AISF participation in Regional and Global Meetings</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline year="2021">
     <comment>
      <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. limited
2. limited and only several programs were conducted
3. limited 4 technical assistance were conducted
4. 1 SOM and 1 MM were conductec</narrative>
     </comment>
    </baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2021-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2021-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. AIS Forum Secretariate is fully operated. 
2. The AIS&#x2019; Framework and Partnership is developed; largely with 10 programs will be conducted. 
3. Strengthened partnership of AIS Members Countries; 5 technical assistances and 4 partnership opportunities will be conducted
4. Strengthened roles of AIS Forum in International Fora; 3 global meetings will be conducted</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. AIS Forum Secretariate is operated partially. 
